# DEV (construction coverage, part 2). Written by the engine's author after the first independent round showed which question constructions were missing:
# role-post wrappers ("holds the post of ..."), "serves as", credit idioms ("is credited with founding"), locus hosts ("which city hosts the headquarters of"),
# "where can I find ...", "the country called K", generic subjects with a locative holder ("what currency do they use in K"), predicate adjectives
# ("which currency is official in K"). This file is TUNED ON; it measures construction coverage, not generalisation. Format: ID | category | text | gold
